      "content": "From a previous project I have a bipartite TF-gene network for Arabidopsis roots saved as source, target and weight columns with non-negative weights. Could you partition it into clusters of TFs and target genes?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"Could you partition it into clusters of TFs and target genes?\" -- the request does not say whether one item may belong to several groups at once: if one group each: CONDOR; if several groups at once: no registered workflow gives this.\n\nBefore I choose a workflow, please tell me: Should each gene, regulator or sample belong to one group only (one group each), or may one belong to several groups at once?\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
